  <!-- 13 / FAQ -->
  <section class="detail-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal" style="text-align: center;">
        <p class="section-index" style="justify-content: center;">FAQ</p>
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions About Transportation Infrastructure Steel Structures</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-container">
        <div class="faq-item reveal">
          <details>
            <summary>Can ZhongSai fabricate pedestrian bridge steel structures?</summary>
            <div class="faq-content">
              <p>Yes. ZhongSai fabricates steel pedestrian bridges, walkways and footbridges per confirmed structural drawings. This includes bridge girders, deck support structures, railing supports and connection components. Specific span configurations, load requirements and vibration control criteria are determined per project design and applicable standards. ZhongSai provides fabrication, export supply and technical installation guidance; local civil works and construction are normally handled by local contractors.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <details>
            <summary>Can large steel structures be segmented for container shipping?</summary>
            <div class="faq-content">
              <p>Yes. For export projects, ZhongSai coordinates component segmentation design to accommodate container shipping dimensions or project-specific transport limitations. This includes designing field bolted connections, splice plates and alignment features for site assembly. Each component is marked with unique identification matching assembly drawings, and detailed packing lists are organized by container for efficient unloading and site erection.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <details>
            <summary>Can you work with complex architectural geometry?</summary>
            <div class="faq-content">
              <p>Yes. ZhongSai has experience fabricating complex, curved and irregular steel structures for infrastructure projects. This includes 3D modeling coordination, precision CNC cutting, dimensional verification and trial assembly where required by project specification. Complex connection details and geometrically demanding components are fabricated with close engineering coordination to ensure proper fit-up during site assembly.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <details>
            <summary>What corrosion protection systems are available?</summary>
            <div class="faq-content">
              <p>ZhongSai can apply various corrosion protection systems per project specifications, including multi-coat painting systems, hot-dip galvanizing and duplex (galvanized plus painted) systems where specified. The appropriate system is selected based on project exposure category, environmental conditions and design service life requirements. Specific coating systems, thicknesses and expected performance are determined per client specifications and applicable standards. ZhongSai does not guarantee fixed corrosion-free service life without confirmed coating system specification and maintenance program.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal">
          <details>
            <summary>Can you perform trial assembly before shipment?</summary>
            <div class="faq-content">
              <p>Yes. Trial assembly can be performed for complex structures where required by project specification or client request. This includes pre-assembling critical connection interfaces, verifying dimensional fit-up and documenting assembly sequence. Trial assembly helps identify any fabrication issues before shipment, reducing site assembly risks. The scope and extent of trial assembly are determined per project requirements and may affect production timeline and cost.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <details>
            <summary>Which design standards can you work with?</summary>
            <div class="faq-content">
              <p>ZhongSai can fabricate steel structures per various design standards based on project country, client specifications and applicable local building codes. This includes Chinese standards (GB), European standards (EN), American standards (AISC/AWS/ASTM) and other project-specified standards. Material grades, welding procedures, inspection requirements and fabrication tolerances are followed per the specified standard. ZhongSai works from confirmed engineering drawings and specifications provided by the project engineer.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <details>
            <summary>Do you provide local construction?</summary>
            <div class="faq-content">
              <p>ZhongSai provides structural detailing, steel fabrication, export supply and technical installation guidance for overseas projects. Local civil works, foundation construction, on-site erection labor and general construction are normally handled by local contractors. ZhongSai can provide installation drawings, assembly guidance, technical support and remote troubleshooting to assist the local construction team. For specific projects where ZhongSai has agreed to provide on-site technical supervision, this scope is confirmed separately per project agreement.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

